                               target=\"_blank\"\n                                       class=\"btn view-btn btn-sm\">\n                                        View Brochure\n                                    <\/a>\n                                \n                                <a target=\"_blank\"\n                                   href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                   class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Reset the Instagram Algorithm (Step-by-Step)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Here is a clear, practical breakdown of exactly\u00a0how to reset\u00a0algorithm\u00a0on Instagram. You do not need any third-party tools or\u00a0special access. Everything can be done inside the app itself.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-reset-ig-algorithm.webp\" alt=\"How to Reset the Instagram Algorithm (Step-by-Step)\" class=\"wp-image-19884\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-reset-ig-algorithm.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-reset-ig-algorithm-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-reset-ig-algorithm-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-reset-ig-algorithm-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-reset-ig-algorithm-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 1: Clear Your Search History<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Your search history directly influences what Instagram suggests to you in the Explore tab and in the Suggestions section. Old searches keep feeding the algorithm outdated signals.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>To clear it:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Go to your Instagram profile&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tap the three lines (menu) in the top right corner&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Go to Settings and Privacy&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tap on Search History&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tap Clear All&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p>Once you do this, Instagram no longer has your old search data to base suggestions on. This is one of the fastest ways to begin resetting what the algorithm thinks you are interested in.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This directly addresses&nbsp;how to reset your search algorithm on Instagram&nbsp;and&nbsp;takes care of&nbsp;how to reset&nbsp;Instagram&nbsp;suggestions algorithm&nbsp;at the same time.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 2: Mute and Unfollow Accounts That No Longer Interest You<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The accounts you follow have a massive impact on your feed. If you follow 500 accounts but only genuinely care about 100 of them, the algorithm gets confused signals.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Go through your following list and:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Unfollow accounts whose content you always scroll past&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Mute accounts that are fine but not something you want to see regularly&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Muting is a gentler&nbsp;option. The account will not know you muted them, and you stop seeing their posts. Unfollowing is stronger and sends a clearer signal to the algorithm that your interests have shifted.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This step is key when you want to&nbsp;reset the IG algorithm&nbsp;at the feed level.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 3: Mark &#8220;Not Interested&#8221; on Irrelevant Content<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Instagram gives you a direct tool to train the algorithm. When you see a post or&nbsp;Reel&nbsp;you do not like or find irrelevant, tap the three dots on&nbsp;it&nbsp;and select &#8220;Not Interested.&#8221;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Do this consistently for a few days. Each time you tap &#8220;Not Interested,&#8221; you are sending a direct signal to Instagram that this type of content does not work for you. Over time, it will stop showing similar posts.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is especially useful if you want to know&nbsp;how to reset&nbsp;Instagram&nbsp;reels algorithm, since Reels are driven heavily by what you engage with or dismiss.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 4: Use the &#8220;Manage Interests&#8221; Feature<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Instagram has a built-in interests management tool that most people never use. Here is how to find it:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Go to your profile&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tap the menu (three lines)&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Go to Settings and Privacy&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tap Ads&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Select Ad Interests or Ad Topics&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p>While this is technically for ads, adjusting your ad interests also influences the kind of content Instagram thinks you want to see. Remove categories that no longer apply to&nbsp;you&nbsp;and you will notice a shift in your feed over time.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This approach works well for&nbsp;how to reset my Instagram algorithm&nbsp;without doing anything drastic.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 5: Engage Actively&nbsp;with&nbsp;the Content You Actually Want to See<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>This is one of the most powerful steps. The algorithm learns from what you do, so you need to&nbsp;show&nbsp;what you want.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Like posts from accounts, you&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Save posts that are relevant to your interests&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Leave comments on content you find valuable&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Watch Reels fully that align with your niche or interest&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Even spending 10 to 15 minutes each day intentionally engaging with content you want to see more of can shift your algorithm noticeably within a week.&nbsp;You can also explore&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-reels-hashtags\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">trending Instagram hashtags<\/a>&nbsp;to discover fresh content and help Instagram better understand your current interests.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 6: Reset Your &#8220;Not Interested&#8221; Signals if Needed<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Did you know you can also undo your &#8220;Not Interested&#8221; signals? If you think you accidentally dismissed too many categories and now your feed is too narrow, here is how to reset:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Go to Settings and Privacy&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tap Content Preferences or Suggested Content&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Review and adjust the categories&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p>This gives you more control over&nbsp;how to reset my Instagram explore algorithm&nbsp;so that the Explore tab starts showing a better variety of content.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 7: Take a Break and Come Back Fresh<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>This sounds simple, but it works. If you stop using Instagram for 5 to 7 days, the algorithm loses strong recent signals about your behavior. When you come back and start engaging with&nbsp;new content, it builds a fresh picture of your interests.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is&nbsp;certainly&nbsp;for personal&nbsp;accounts;&nbsp;a short break combined with intentional engagement when you return can noticeably improve your feed.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 8: Re-engage With Accounts You Actually Like<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>After clearing out the noise, go back to the accounts you genuinely enjoy and interact with them on purpose. Like their recent posts, leave a real comment, reply to their Stories, and save posts you find valuable. This is not about gaming the system. It is about giving Instagram&nbsp;accurate&nbsp;data so it can serve you better.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When you engage meaningfully with specific accounts, Instagram learns that those accounts matter to you. It then shows you more of their content and recommends similar accounts in your Explore tab and Suggestions.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This step is often overlooked, but it is one of the most important parts of resetting the Instagram algorithm. The reset is not just about removing bad signals; it is equally about building strong new ones.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T123426_340_1785490284771_211381.webp\" alt=\"AI Engineering Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/how-to-build-an-ai-agent-from-scratch?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-03T133829_740__1__1786010890597_768466.webp\" alt=\"How to Build an AI Agent from Scratch \" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/soc-analyst-career-demand-in-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-04T111115_404_1786011909630_974751.webp\" alt=\"SOC Analyst Career Demand in 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/booming-digital-marketing-career-in-ai-era?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-07T104930_382_1786105407836_186872.webp\" alt=\"Booming Digital Marketing Career in AI Era\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cybersecurity-professional-career-roadmap-2026-2?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-05T122121_005_1786351858212_930412.webp\" alt=\"Cybersecurity Professional Career Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What Happens After You Reset Your Instagram Algorithm?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Many people wonder&nbsp;how long&nbsp;does it take&nbsp;for&nbsp;Instagram&nbsp;algorithm to reset. The honest answer is that there is no single timeline. Some users see changes within&nbsp;48 hours. For others, it takes 1 to 2 weeks of consistent intentional engagement.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here is what to expect:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>In the first few days&nbsp;&#8211;&nbsp;<\/strong>your&nbsp;feed may feel a little random or sparse. This is normal. The algorithm is recalibrating based on your new signals.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>After one week &#8211;&nbsp;<\/strong>you should start seeing more relevant content in your Explore tab and a cleaner feed with posts you actually care about.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>After two to four weeks &#8211;&nbsp;<\/strong>your Reels section should align much better with your current interests.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The key thing to remember is that the reset is not a one-time fix. It is the start of a new pattern. You need to continue engaging intentionally to keep the algorithm trained correctly going forward.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bonus Tip: Create a New Content&nbsp;Pattern<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>For all those Instagram users who want to know the bonus tips to quickly\u00a0reset\u00a0IG\u00a0algorithm,\u00a0it\u2019s\u00a0time to consider a few tips. This will\u00a0assist\u00a0them in getting the content they are interested in and exploring a lot of new things.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/create-new-content-pattern.webp\" alt=\"Bonus Tip: Create a New Content\u00a0Pattern\" class=\"wp-image-19886\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/create-new-content-pattern.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/create-new-content-pattern-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/create-new-content-pattern-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/create-new-content-pattern-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/create-new-content-pattern-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Follow New Accounts in Your Interests&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Search for creators and topics you genuinely&nbsp;enjoy and&nbsp;follow relevant accounts to help Instagram understand your updated preferences.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Unfollow Accounts You No Longer Engage With&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Remove accounts whose content no longer interests you. This reduces unwanted signals that influence your recommendations.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Use the \u201cNot Interested\u201d Option Frequently&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Whenever irrelevant posts appear in Explore or Reels, mark them as &#8220;Not Interested&#8221; to train Instagram to show&nbsp;less&nbsp;similar content.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Engage More with Content You Like&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Like, save, comment on, and share posts that match your interests. These actions send strong signals to Instagram&#8217;s recommendation system.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Explore New Content Categories Regularly&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Spend time discovering fresh topics, hashtags, and creators. Consistent interaction with&nbsp;new content&nbsp;helps reshape your feed and recommendations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-cad7a33219fe7567f38d42b378b63095\"><strong>Read More Guides Related to Instagram<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-reels-hashtags\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Best Instagram Reels Hashtags<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-increase-instagram-followers\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How to Increase Instagram Followers<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-prompt-ideas\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram Prompt Ideas<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-captions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Best Instagram Post Captions<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/short-instagram-captions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Short Instagram Captions<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/one-word-instagram-captions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">One Word Instagram Captions<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-bio-ideas\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram Bio Ideas<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-notes-ideas\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram Notes Ideas<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-on-instagram\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How to Make Money on Instagram<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-username-ideas\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram Username Ideas<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-study-captions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Study Captions for Instagram<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/view-instagram-story-anonymously\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ways to View IG Stories Anonymously<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-instagram-algorithm-works\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How Insta Algorithm Works<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/graduation-captions-for-instagram\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Graduation Captions for Instagram<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/funny-instagram-captions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Funny Instagram Captions<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/nature-instagram-captions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Nature Captions for Instagram<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can You Change Instagram Recommendations Permanently?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Many users wonder:&nbsp;<\/strong>can you&nbsp;reset Instagram algorithm&nbsp;settings or completely change how Instagram works for them. The answer is&nbsp;no,&nbsp;you cannot directly control or override Instagram&#8217;s algorithm.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>What you can do is influence it through your actions. Instagram learns from the content you watch, like, save, share, and interact with. The more consistently you engage with content you enjoy and avoid content you&nbsp;don&#8217;t, the better your recommendations become.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It&#8217;s&nbsp;also important to know that Instagram uses different ranking systems for Feed, Reels, Explore, Stories, and Search.&nbsp;That&#8217;s&nbsp;why changing recommendations in one section may not affect&nbsp;others.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If&nbsp;you&#8217;re&nbsp;wondering&nbsp;how to reset&nbsp;IG&nbsp;algorithm, there&nbsp;isn&#8217;t&nbsp;a dedicated reset button. Instead, you can gradually retrain Instagram by:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Clearing search history&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Marking irrelevant content as &#8220;Not Interested&#8221;&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Unfollowing accounts that no longer match your interests&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Engaging with content you want to see more often&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Many people search for ways to&nbsp;reset&nbsp;IG&nbsp;algorithm, but the most effective method is consistently giving Instagram better signals over time.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Also,&nbsp;deleting&nbsp;and reinstalling the app&nbsp;won&#8217;t&nbsp;help because your data is stored on Instagram&#8217;s servers. Creating a new account can reset recommendations, but&nbsp;you&#8217;ll&nbsp;lose your followers, engagement history, and account credibility, making it an unnecessary step for most users.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-d72f351059e80039135382f58233f821\"><strong>Explore Our Most Popular Marketing Courses<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogTable&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/performance-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogTable&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Performance Marketing Course<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/ai-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI Course<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quick Recap: How to Reset Instagram Feed in Minutes<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Here is a fast summary of everything covered:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Clear your Instagram Search History from Settings&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Unfollow or mute accounts that no longer match your interests&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tap &#8220;Not Interested&#8221; on posts and Reels that are&nbsp;off topic&nbsp;for you&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Manage your ad interests inside Settings to shift content categories&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Actively engage with content that matches what you want to see more of&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Review and adjust your Suggested Content preferences&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Consider taking a short break and returning with fresh, intentional engagement&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p>Doing&nbsp;all&nbsp;these steps together gives you the best chance of a meaningful algorithm to reset within one to two weeks.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=Content_Banner&amp;utm_campaign=SEO&amp;utm_page=\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1546\" height=\"380\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course.webp\" alt=\"Online Digital Marketing Course\" class=\"wp-image-14520\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course.webp 1546w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course-300x74.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course-1024x252.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course-768x189.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course-1536x378.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1546px) 100vw, 1546px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">&nbsp;FAQs about Resetting Instagram Algorithm<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block\"><div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781335340801\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">1. How do I reset my Instagram algorithm?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Go to your Settings and clear your Search History. Then unfollow irrelevant accounts, tap &#8220;Not Interested&#8221; on content that does not match your interests, and start engaging consistently with content you\u00a0care\u00a0about. There is no single button, but these steps together effectively retrain the algorithm.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781335351447\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">2. How do I reset\u00a0Instagram\u00a0suggestions algorithm?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">You can reset Instagram suggestions by clearing your search history, marking unwanted content as \u201cNot Interested,\u201d and engaging more with content you\u00a0actually like. This helps Instagram understand your new interests and improve recommendations.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781335370316\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">3. How do I reset my Instagram Explore algorithm?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">To reset your\u00a0Instagram\u00a0Explore algorithm, avoid interacting with irrelevant posts and start liking, saving, and watching content related to your interests. Over time, Instagram updates your Explore feed based on your activity.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781335383431\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. How long does it take for\u00a0Instagram\u00a0algorithm to reset?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Most users notice changes within 48 to\u00a072 hours\u00a0for small adjustments. A full reset, where your feed and Explore tab feel genuinely fresh and relevant, typically takes one to two weeks of intentional engagement. The more actively you apply the steps in this guide, the faster you will see results.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781335403462\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. Is there a way to reset the Instagram algorithm?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, but not through a single setting. The most effective approach combines clearing your search history,\u00a0muting\u00a0or unfollowing irrelevant accounts, using the &#8220;Not Interested&#8221; feature, and actively engaging with content you want to see more of.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781335418210\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">6. Ways to reset\u00a0Instagram\u00a0algorithm without losing followers?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Absolutely. You do not need to\u00a0unfollow\u00a0everyone. Muting accounts you do not want to see, clearing your search history, and using the &#8220;Not Interested&#8221; button are all ways to reset your algorithm without losing a single follower.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781335458300\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">7. Does\u00a0deleting\u00a0and\u00a0reinstalling\u00a0Instagram reset the algorithm?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">No.\u00a0Deleting\u00a0the app only removes it from your device. Your account data, including your engagement history and content preferences, is stored on Instagram&#8217;s servers. When you log back in, everything is exactly as you left it. The only\u00a0real way\u00a0to reset your algorithm is through the behavioral steps covered in this guide.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781335475087\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">9. Can I reset the algorithm for just Reels or just the Explore page?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Not directly, but you can target specific surfaces. For Reels, focus on using the &#8220;Not Interested&#8221; option on videos you skip and fully\u00a0watch\u00a0Reels you enjoy. For Explore, clearing your search history and mutin