/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335340801","position":1,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335340801","name":"1. How do I reset my Instagram algorithm?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Go to your Settings and clear your Search History. Then unfollow irrelevant accounts, tap \"Not Interested\" on content that does not match your interests, and start engaging consistently with content you\u00a0care\u00a0about. There is no single button, but these steps together effectively retrain the algorithm.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335351447","position":2,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335351447","name":"2. How do I reset\u00a0Instagram\u00a0suggestions algorithm?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can reset Instagram suggestions by clearing your search history, marking unwanted content as \u201cNot Interested,\u201d and engaging more with content you\u00a0actually like. This helps Instagram understand your new interests and improve recommendations.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335370316","position":3,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335370316","name":"3. How do I reset my Instagram Explore algorithm?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"To reset your\u00a0Instagram\u00a0Explore algorithm, avoid interacting with irrelevant posts and start liking, saving, and watching content related to your interests. Over time, Instagram updates your Explore feed based on your activity.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335383431","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335383431","name":"4. How long does it take for\u00a0Instagram\u00a0algorithm to reset?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most users notice changes within 48 to\u00a072 hours\u00a0for small adjustments. A full reset, where your feed and Explore tab feel genuinely fresh and relevant, typically takes one to two weeks of intentional engagement. The more actively you apply the steps in this guide, the faster you will see results.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335403462","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335403462","name":"5. Is there a way to reset the Instagram algorithm?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, but not through a single setting. The most effective approach combines clearing your search history,\u00a0muting\u00a0or unfollowing irrelevant accounts, using the \"Not Interested\" feature, and actively engaging with content you want to see more of.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335418210","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335418210","name":"6. Ways to reset\u00a0Instagram\u00a0algorithm without losing followers?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. You do not need to\u00a0unfollow\u00a0everyone. Muting accounts you do not want to see, clearing your search history, and using the \"Not Interested\" button are all ways to reset your algorithm without losing a single follower.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335458300","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335458300","name":"7. Does\u00a0deleting\u00a0and\u00a0reinstalling\u00a0Instagram reset the algorithm?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No.\u00a0Deleting\u00a0the app only removes it from your device. Your account data, including your engagement history and content preferences, is stored on Instagram's servers. When you log back in, everything is exactly as you left it. The only\u00a0real way\u00a0to reset your algorithm is through the behavioral steps covered in this guide.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335475087","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335475087","name":"9. Can I reset the algorithm for just Reels or just the Explore page?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not directly, but you can target specific surfaces. For Reels, focus on using the \"Not Interested\" option on videos you skip and fully\u00a0watch\u00a0Reels you enjoy. For Explore, clearing your search history and muting irrelevant accounts will have the most impact. Consistently doing both will improve all areas over time.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335491826","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-reset-instagram-algorithm\/#faq-question-1781335491826","name":"10. Is resetting the Instagram algorithm safe?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, resetting or retraining the algorithm through normal Instagram settings and engagement\u00a0behavior\u00a0is completely safe.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/19840","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/15"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=19840"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/19840\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":19887,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/19840\/revisions\/19887"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/19841"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=19840"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=19840"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=19840"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}